## ⚡ 5. Executive Cadence & Autonomous Workflows

OpenExecutive provides turn-key autonomous business workflows:
- `morning_brief.py`: Autonomous aggregation of overnight emails, metrics, and blocker alerts.
- `mbr.py`: Monthly Business Review generation synthesizing metrics across departments.
- `annual_plan.py` / `quarterly_plan.py`: Hierarchical OKR alignment and capacity planning.
- `crisis_comms.py`: Immediate zero-draft PR and internal talking points during incidents.
- `wait_for_human.py`: Strict HITL barrier for high-blast-radius executive decisions.
